{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a self-hosted Qwen architecture on PAI-EAS behind an AI Gateway for per-team quotas, failover and private VPC access."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","alb","ai-gateway","pai-eas","nat","model-studio","sls"]}
{"t":"req","text":"Data stays in Singapore","regions":["ap-southeast-1"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"access","text":"Internal users only, accessed over private network","alt":"Public-facing with WAF"}
{"t":"group","id":"internal","kind":"external","label":"Internal users","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Internal users (2000 concurrent)","group":"internal","why":"About 2000 internal users calling the model."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"AI VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Private load balancer distributing traffic to the AI gateway."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"private"}
{"t":"node","id":"gateway","product":"ai-gateway","label":"AI Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Per-team token quotas, routing and failover policies."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-gateway","from":"alb","to":"gateway"}
{"t":"node","id":"llm-primary","product":"pai-eas","label":"Qwen primary","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Dedicated GPU serving the large Qwen model as primary target."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-llm","from":"gateway","to":"llm-primary","label":"private endpoint"}
{"t":"node","id":"nat","product":"nat","label":"NAT Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Lets PAI-EAS reach Model Studio for fallback inference."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-llm-nat","from":"llm-primary","to":"nat","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"fallback","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio fallback","group":"sg","why":"Hosted Qwen fallback when dedicated capacity is exhausted."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-nat-fallback","from":"nat","to":"fallback","label":"API"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes gateway and model logs for monitoring and auditing."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-logs","from":"gateway","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"failover-target","text":"Should failover go to hosted Model Studio or a second dedicated PAI-EAS deployment?","options":["Hosted Model Studio","Second PAI-EAS cluster"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"team-count","text":"How many teams need separate token quotas?","options":["Under 10","10 to 50","Over 50"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Self-hosted Qwen on PAI-EAS behind AI Gateway with per-team quotas, ALB ingress, NAT for Model Studio failover and SLS logging."}

{"t":"say","text":"我来为您设计一个基于 PAI-EAS 和 Elasticsearch 的 VPC 内网 RAG 知识库问答架构。"}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","alb","pai-eas","elasticsearch","oss","nat","ai-gateway"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"internal-access","text":"仅限内部员工通过内网访问","alt":"公网暴露并加 WAF 防护"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"RAG VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"内部用户","group":null,"why":"通过浏览器向知识库提问的员工。"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"内网 ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"将请求分发到 PAI-EAS 推理服务。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"ai-gw","product":"ai-gateway","label":"AI Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"统一路由、限流与 token 管控。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-ai-gw","from":"alb","to":"ai-gw"}
{"t":"say","text":"PAI-EAS 承载 RAG 流程与大模型推理，向量库与文档均留在 VPC 内。"}
{"t":"node","id":"rag","product":"pai-eas","label":"RAG 服务","group":"vpc","why":"处理文档切分、检索编排与回答生成。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ai-gw-rag","from":"ai-gw","to":"rag","label":"private endpoint"}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"pai-eas","label":"Qwen LLM 推理","group":"vpc","why":"运行自部署 Qwen 模型，提供专属 GPU 算力。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-rag-llm","from":"rag","to":"llm","label":"推理"}
{"t":"node","id":"vector-db","product":"elasticsearch","label":"Elasticsearch 向量库","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"存储文档向量，数据完全保留在 VPC 内网。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-rag-vector","from":"rag","to":"vector-db","label":"向量检索"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"内部文档存储","group":"sg","why":"存放原始内部文档供 RAG 服务读取。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-rag-docs","from":"rag","to":"docs","label":"读取文档"}
{"t":"say","text":"NAT 网关用于 PAI-EAS 拉取模型镜像或调用外部 API。"}
{"t":"node","id":"nat","product":"nat","label":"NAT 网关","group":"vpc","why":"为 PAI-EAS 提供出站网络访问能力。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-rag-nat","from":"rag","to":"nat","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"doc-ingestion","text":"内部文档如何更新到知识库？","options":["手动上传至 OSS","API 自动推送","定时批量同步"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"user-network","text":"内部用户如何接入该 VPC？","options":["企业专线 Express Connect","SSL VPN","已在同 VPC 内"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"VPC 内网 RAG 架构：ALB + AI Gateway + PAI-EAS（RAG 与 Qwen）+ Elasticsearch 向量库 + OSS 文档存储。"}

{"t":"say","text":"Ich zeichne ein Multi-Node-Training auf Lingjun mit CPFS-Speicher und anschließendem Serving auf PAI-EAS in Frankfurt."}
{"t":"req","text":"Trainingsdaten müssen in Frankfurt bleiben","regions":["eu-central-1"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["pai-dlc","lingjun","cpfs","oss","pai-eas","nat","sls","acr"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"model-source","text":"Eigenes oder Open-Source 30B Modell, kein gehostetes Qwen","alt":"Qwen-Modell über Model Studio"}
{"t":"group","id":"frankfurt","kind":"region","label":"Frankfurt (eu-central-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"AI VPC","parent":"frankfurt"}
{"t":"node","id":"notebooks","product":"pai-dsw","label":"Dev Notebooks","group":"vpc","why":"Interaktive Entwicklung und Experimente vor dem Training."}
{"t":"node","id":"training","product":"pai-dlc","label":"Distributed Training Jobs","group":"vpc","why":"Verteiltes Fine-Tuning des 30B Modells als managed Job."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-notebooks-training","from":"notebooks","to":"training","label":"start jobs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"lingjun","product":"lingjun","label":"Lingjun GPU Cluster","group":"vpc","why":"Bare-Metal GPUs mit RDMA für schnelles Multi-Node-Training. Zugang nur über Account Manager freigeschaltet."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-training-lingjun","from":"training","to":"lingjun","label":"runs on"}
{"t":"node","id":"cpfs","product":"cpfs","label":"CPFS Shared Storage","group":"vpc","why":"Paralleles Dateisystem mit hohem Durchsatz für Trainingsdaten und Checkpoints."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-lingjun-cpfs","from":"lingjun","to":"cpfs","label":"read/write"}
{"t":"node","id":"oss","product":"oss","label":"Model Artifacts","group":"frankfurt","why":"Speichert finale Modellgewichte und Datensätze dauerhaft."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-training-oss","from":"training","to":"oss","label":"checkpoints"}
{"t":"node","id":"serving","product":"pai-eas","label":"Model Serving","group":"vpc","why":"Online-Inferenz des trainierten 30B Modells mit Autoscaling."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-training-serving","from":"training","to":"serving","label":"deploy","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-serving-oss","from":"serving","to":"oss","label":"load model"}
{"t":"node","id":"nat","product":"nat","label":"NAT Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Ausgehender Internetzugang für Paketinstallationen im VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-serving-nat","from":"serving","to":"nat","label":"egress","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs & Metrics","group":"frankfurt","why":"Zentrale Logs und Metriken für Training und Serving."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-training-logs","from":"training","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-serving-logs","from":"serving","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"access-pattern","text":"Wie greifen Nutzer oder Anwendungen auf das Modell zu?","options":["Öffentliche API über ALB","Privater VPC-Endpunkt","Beides"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"data-volume","text":"Wie groß ist der Trainingsdatensatz ungefähr?","options":["Unter 1 TB","1 bis 10 TB","Über 10 TB"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Multi-Node 30B-Training auf Lingjun mit CPFS, Checkpoints in OSS und Serving über PAI-EAS in Frankfurt."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a custom agentic RL post-training design in Singapore using PAI-DLC for training and Agent Sandbox for rollouts."}
{"t":"say","text":"Note: this is a custom design with no official Alibaba Cloud reference; the nearest official pattern is the ACK plus VeRL walkthrough."}
{"t":"plan","products":["pai-dlc","agent-sandbox","oss","model-studio","sls"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"base-model","text":"Using hosted Qwen models via Model Studio for policy inference","alt":"Self-hosted model on PAI-EAS"}
{"t":"assume","id":"rl-algo","text":"Using GRPO or PPO style RL algorithm","alt":"DPO or other preference optimization"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"training","product":"pai-dlc","label":"PAI-DLC Training Jobs","group":"sg","why":"Runs distributed RL training jobs that orchestrate rollout requests to sandboxes."}
{"t":"node","id":"sandbox","product":"agent-sandbox","label":"Agent Sandboxes","group":"sg","why":"Provides thousands of short-lived isolated environments for RL rollout execution."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-training-sandbox","from":"training","to":"sandbox","label":"rollouts","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio","group":"sg","why":"Hosts the base Qwen model for policy inference during rollouts."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-sandbox-llm","from":"sandbox","to":"llm","label":"inference","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"storage","product":"oss","label":"OSS Storage","group":"sg","why":"Stores training datasets, checkpoints and rollout results."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-training-storage","from":"training","to":"storage","label":"checkpoints","kind":"data"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-sandbox-storage","from":"sandbox","to":"storage","label":"results","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS Logs","group":"sg","why":"Collects training metrics, sandbox logs and RL reward signals."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-training-logs","from":"training","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-sandbox-logs","from":"sandbox","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"model-choice","text":"Will you use hosted Qwen models or do you need to train on your own custom weights?","options":["Hosted Qwen via Model Studio","Custom weights on PAI-EAS"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"scale","text":"How many concurrent sandboxes do you expect at peak rollout?","options":["Under 1000","1000 to 5000","Over 5000"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Custom agentic RL architecture in Singapore with PAI-DLC orchestrating Agent Sandbox rollouts, Model Studio for inference, OSS for storage and SLS for observability."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a serverless coding agent in Singapore using AgentRun for hosting and Agent Sandbox for isolated code execution."}
{"t":"req","text":"We don't run Kubernetes and won't","avoid":["kubernetes","ack","acs"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","agentrun","agent-sandbox","model-studio","tablestore","sls","nat"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"access","text":"Internal team access only","alt":"Public API access"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Developers","group":"internet","why":"Team members sending prompts to the coding agent."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"agent","product":"agentrun","label":"Coding agent","group":"sg","why":"Serverless runtime hosting the coding agent without Kubernetes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-agent","from":"users","to":"agent","label":"prompts"}
{"t":"node","id":"sandbox","product":"agent-sandbox","label":"Code sandbox","group":"sg","why":"Isolated environment where agent-written code runs safely."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agent-sandbox","from":"agent","to":"sandbox","label":"execute"}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio","group":"sg","why":"Provides Qwen models for code generation and reasoning."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agent-llm","from":"agent","to":"llm","label":"inference"}
{"t":"node","id":"memory","product":"tablestore","label":"Agent memory","group":"sg","why":"Stores conversation history and agent state at scale."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agent-memory","from":"agent","to":"memory","label":"state"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Collects agent traces and sandbox execution logs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agent-logs","from":"agent","to":"logs","kind":"control","label":"traces"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-sandbox-logs","from":"sandbox","to":"logs","kind":"control","label":"exec logs"}
{"t":"node","id":"nat","product":"nat","label":"NAT Gateway","group":"sg","why":"Gives the agent outbound internet for package installs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agent-nat","from":"agent","to":"nat","kind":"control","label":"egress"}
{"t":"ask","id":"tools","text":"Does the agent need to call external tools or MCP servers?","options":["Yes, custom MCP tools","No, code execution only"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"team-size","text":"How many developers will use this agent concurrently?","options":["Under 10","10 to 50","Over 50"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Serverless coding agent on AgentRun with Agent Sandbox isolation, Model Studio inference, Tablestore memory and SLS logging in Singapore."}

{"t":"say","text":"In Singapore, A10, T4, V100 and P100 GPUs are generally available for inference; newer cards need sales confirmation."}
{"t":"rec","product":"pai-eas","fit":"primary","why":"Managed online serving for your own models on dedicated GPU instances in Singapore."}
{"t":"rec","product":"model-studio","fit":"complement","why":"Hosted Qwen model APIs without managing any GPU infrastructure yourself."}
{"t":"done","summary":"A10, T4, V100 and P100 are generally available in Singapore for inference via PAI-EAS; newer GPUs require sales confirmation."}

{"t":"say","text":"PAI-LangStudio isn't in the catalog. I'll draw a document Q&A agent using Dify on ACK with Model Studio and Milvus."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","dify-on-ack","ack","model-studio","milvus","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"exposure","text":"Public-facing Q&A agent","alt":"Internal only"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"About 10k users","alt":"Over 100k users"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Users","group":"internet","why":"People asking questions about documents."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the agent domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates and secures traffic to the agent."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Agent VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes traffic into the cluster."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"ack","product":"ack","label":"ACK","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the Dify containers across two zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-ack","from":"alb","to":"ack"}
{"t":"node","id":"dify","product":"dify-on-ack","label":"Dify Q&A Agent","group":"vpc","why":"Low-code builder for the RAG Q&A workflow."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-dify","from":"ack","to":"dify"}
{"t":"say","text":"Dify calls Model Studio for LLM answers and Milvus for document retrieval, reading files from OSS."}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio","group":"sg","why":"Hosted Qwen models that answer user questions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dify-llm","from":"dify","to":"llm","label":"LLM API"}
{"t":"node","id":"vector-db","product":"milvus","label":"Milvus","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Vector store for document embeddings used in RAG."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dify-vector","from":"dify","to":"vector-db","label":"search"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"Documents","group":"sg","why":"Stores uploaded PDFs and source documents."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dify-docs","from":"dify","to":"docs","label":"read"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Collects agent traces and application logs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dify-logs","from":"dify","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"doc-volume","text":"How many documents will you upload?","options":["Under 1,000","1,000 to 50,000","Over 50,000"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"access","text":"Who uses this Q&A agent?","options":["Public customers","Internal employees only"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Document Q&A agent built with Dify on ACK, Model Studio for LLM, Milvus for RAG search and OSS for documents."}

{"t":"say","text":"ACS Agent Sandbox has no GPUs, so fine-tuning must run on PAI-DLC. I'll draw the proper training setup."}
{"t":"plan","products":["pai-dsw","pai-dlc","pai-model-gallery","oss","cpfs"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"region","text":"Singapore region for Model Studio and PAI services","alt":"Another supported region like Tokyo or Virginia"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Training VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"notebook","product":"pai-dsw","label":"Dev notebook","group":"vpc","why":"Interactive workspace to prepare data and launch jobs."}
{"t":"node","id":"gallery","product":"pai-model-gallery","label":"Model Gallery","group":"vpc","why":"No-code Qwen3-8B SFT config that starts DLC and EAS."}
{"t":"node","id":"training","product":"pai-dlc","label":"Fine-tune job","group":"vpc","why":"Runs distributed GPU training for Qwen3-8B fine-tuning."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-notebook-gallery","from":"notebook","to":"gallery","label":"configure","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gallery-training","from":"gallery","to":"training","label":"launch","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"dataset","product":"oss","label":"Training dataset","group":"sg","why":"Stores input data and exported fine-tuned checkpoints."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-training-dataset","from":"training","to":"dataset","label":"read/write","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"scratch","product":"cpfs","label":"Scratch storage","group":"vpc","why":"High-throughput parallel file system for multi-node training."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-training-scratch","from":"training","to":"scratch","label":"IO","kind":"data"}
{"t":"ask","id":"training-method","text":"Do you prefer no-code fine-tuning via Model Gallery or custom training scripts?","options":["No-code (Model Gallery)","Custom scripts (PAI-DLC directly)"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"serve-after","text":"Should I add a PAI-EAS serving endpoint for the fine-tuned model?","options":["Yes, add serving","No, just training"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Qwen3-8B fine-tuning uses PAI-DLC with OSS and CPFS; ACS Agent Sandbox has no GPUs."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a furniture e-commerce site optimized for Southeast Asia, using ESA for edge acceleration and Singapore as the hub."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","tair","rds","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"public","text":"Public-facing website","alt":"Internal only"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"Moderate traffic across Southeast Asia","alt":"High traffic with flash sales"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"SEA customers","group":"internet","why":"Browsing handmade furniture from Southeast Asia."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves shop domain to ESA edge."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates images and pages across SEA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Shop VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes traffic to app servers in two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Protects checkout and catalog from attacks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the furniture shop backend."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales servers during peak browsing hours."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Adding cache, database, image storage and logging."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Keeps carts and sessions fast."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Orders DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores orders and product catalog reliably."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Furniture images","group":"sg","why":"Stores high-res photos ESA serves."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-media","from":"esa","to":"media","label":"images"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Central logs for troubleshooting."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"platform","text":"Is this a custom-built shop or an existing platform like Magento or WooCommerce?","options":["Custom built","Magento / WooCommerce","Other platform"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"payments","text":"Which payment methods do you need for SEA customers?","options":["Credit card only","E-wallets (GrabPay, GoPay)","Bank transfer"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Two-zone furniture shop in Singapore with ESA edge acceleration for SEA, ALB with WAF, ECS, Tair, RDS and OSS."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw an internal HR portal in Singapore, reachable only from your company network via VPN Gateway."}
{"t":"req","text":"Only employees on the company network should reach it"}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","onprem-dc","vpn-gateway","alb","ecs","rds","sls"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"new-build","text":"New build on Alibaba Cloud","alt":"Existing servers on-premises"}
{"t":"group","id":"company-net","kind":"onprem","label":"Company network","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Employees","group":"company-net","why":"400 staff submitting leave requests from the office."}
{"t":"node","id":"onprem-dc","product":"onprem-dc","label":"On-premises data center","group":"company-net","why":"Company network gateway for the IPsec tunnel."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"HR VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"vpn","product":"vpn-gateway","label":"VPN Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"IPsec tunnel so only company traffic reaches the VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-onprem-vpn","from":"onprem-dc","to":"vpn","label":"IPsec"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"Internal ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Private load balancer with no public IP."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-vpn-alb","from":"vpn","to":"alb"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"HR portal servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the leave-request app across two zones."}
